    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Welcome to Tradie Tapper</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Aussie-built idle game where you tap, hire, and rebirth your way to tradie stardom.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Start from a bare dirt lot and build your empire one job site at a time. Hire sparkies, plumbers, roofers and more, each tradie adding to your passive income machine. Upgrade their gear, smash milestones, and take on brutally scaled rebirth contracts as you climb the ranks.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you're smashing tinnies or topping leaderboards, one thing\u2019s for sure: the grind never stops.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tap to earn coins and upgrade your tradie crew</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hire Electricians, Builders, Apprentices, and more</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >20+ unique backgrounds from trailer parks to disaster zones</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rebirth system with randomized mutators and scaling challenge</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Skill tree integration for long-term progression</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Steam leaderboards and achievement tracking</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Offline support with anti-cheat protections</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Built with pixel charm, Aussie humour, and a relentless pace</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Aussie-made. Meme-fueled. Built for the grind.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Join us in Early Access and help shape the future of Tradie Tapper, one contract at a time.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Welcome to Tradie Tapper</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Aussie-built idle game where you tap, hire, and rebirth your way to tradie stardom.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Start from a bare dirt lot and build your empire one job site at a time. Hire sparkies, plumbers, roofers and more, each tradie adding to your passive income machine. Upgrade their gear, smash milestones, and take on brutally scaled rebirth contracts as you climb the ranks.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you're smashing tinnies or topping leaderboards, one thing\u2019s for sure: the grind never stops.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tap to earn coins and upgrade your tradie crew</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hire Electricians, Builders, Apprentices, and more</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >20+ unique backgrounds from trailer parks to disaster zones</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rebirth system with randomized mutators and scaling challenge</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Skill tree integration for long-term progression</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Steam leaderboards and achievement tracking</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Offline support with anti-cheat protections</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Built with pixel charm, Aussie humour, and a relentless pace</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Aussie-made. Meme-fueled. Built for the grind.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Join us in Early Access and help shape the future of Tradie Tapper, one contract at a time.</p>",
    "short_description": "Tap, hire, and rebirth your way to tradie stardom in this Aussie-made idle clicker. Build job sites, collect gear, unlock skill trees, and climb the monthly leaderboards. Whether you're laying bricks or chasing ranks, the grind never stops.",
